00:55:51.958 --> 00:55:52.900
That makes you feel uncomfortable,

00:55:52.900 --> 00:55:57.370
but you know that if you're
in ocean water or water,

00:55:57.370 --> 00:56:01.060
at 70˚ you're, that's cold.

